<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four stocks rose, four fell and 12 were flat in 10.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,604.4 points, 0.3 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.3 percent to 150.5 zlotys in a 17.9-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
